        "# Concurrency\n",
        "\n",
        "Concurrency is the ability to make progress on multiple tasks over overlapping periods. Tasks can be interleaved without necessarily running in parallel.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-concurrency)"
      ]
    }
